  "query": "INSERT INTO checks (habit_id, value, checked_at)\r\nVALUES ($1, $2, $3)\r\nON CONFLICT (habit_id, ((checked_at AT TIME ZONE 'UTC')::date))\r\nDO UPDATE SET value = checks.value + EXCLUDED.value\r\nRETURNING\r\n    check_id as id,\r\n    habit_id, value,\r\n    checked_at;",
